==Icelandic==

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/ˈvɪnːa/|lang=is}}
* {{rhymes|ɪnːa|lang=is}}

===Etymology 1===
From {{etyl|non|is}} {{m|non|vinna}}.

====Noun====
{{is-noun|f|vinnu|-}}

# a [[job]], an [[occupation]], an [[employment]]{{jump|is|employment|s}}
#: ''Að [[hafa vinnu|hafa '''vinnu''']].''
#:: To be '''employed'''.
# [[work]], [[labour]]{{jump|is|labour|s}}

=====Declension=====
{{is-decl-noun-f-w1|v|i|nn|pl=-}}

=====Derived terms=====
* {{l|is|hafa vinnu}}
* {{l|is|heimavinna}}
* {{l|is|erfiðisvinna}}
* {{l|is|vinnuhlé}}

=====Synonyms=====
* {{jump|s|is|employment}} {{l|is|atvinna}}
* {{jump|s|is|labour}} {{l|is|verk}}

===Etymology 2===
From {{etyl|non|is}} {{m|non|vinna}}, from {{etyl|gem-pro|is}} {{m|gem-pro|*winnaną}}, from {{etyl|ine-pro|is}} {{m|ine-pro|*wen-||to strive, wish, desire, love}}. Related to {{etyl|fo|-}} and {{etyl|sv|-}} {{m|is|vinna}}, {{etyl|no|-}} {{m|no|vinne}}, {{etyl|en|-}} {{m|en|win}}, {{etyl|nl|-}} {{m|nl|winnen}}, and {{etyl|de|-}} {{m|de|gewinnen}}.

====Verb====
{{is-verb-strong|vann|unnu|unnið}}

# {{label|is|intransitive}} to [[work]], to [[labour]]{{jump|is|to work, to labour|s}}
#: ''Ég nenni ekki að '''vinna'''.''
#:: I don't want to '''work'''.
#: ''Ég '''vinn''' allan daginn.''
#:: I '''work''' all day.
# {{label|is|transitive|with accusative}} to [[do]], to [[perform]] (e.g. a task){{jump|is|to do, to perform|s}}
# {{label|is|intransitive}} to [[win]], to achieve [[victory]] {{jump|is|to win, to achieve victory|s}}
#: ''Ég '''vann'''!''
#:: I '''won'''!
# {{label|is|transitive|with accusative}} to [[win]], to [[triumph]] in (e.g. a game)
#: ''Við '''unnum''' keppnina.''
#:: We '''won''' the tournament.
# {{label|is|transitive|with accusative}} to [[conquer]], to [[beat]], to [[defeat]]{{jump|is|to conquer|s}}
#: ''Fjölnismenn '''unnu''' Val 2–1 í gær.''
#:: [[w:Ungmennafélagið Fjölnir|Fjölnir]] '''beat''' [[w:Valur Football Club|Valur]] 2–1 yesterday.
# {{label|is|transitive|with accusative}} to [[win]], to [[obtain]], to [[get]]{{jump|is|to win, to obtain|s}}
#: ''Herinn '''vann''' borgina frá uppreisnarmönnunum.''
#:: The army '''took''' the city from the rebels.

=====Conjugation=====
{{is-conj-s3|v|i|nn}}

